e gateway refuses for three reasons.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-038\",\n      \"verdict\": \"CONTRADICTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The gateway refuses a request for three reasons: a credential may be suspended, a route may be closed for maintenance, or a body may exceed the 5 megabyte limit\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The three reasons listed are explicitly presented as non-cap refusals, so none of them is a rate limit cap.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-039\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text does not characterize which of the three reasons are or are not related to traffic amount in the window.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-040\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a credential may be suspended\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-041\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"a route may be closed for maintenance\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states a route can be closed for maintenance, equivalent to being repaired.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-042\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not state that oversized bodies are refused before being read.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-043\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A loop that waits and retries against a suspended credential spends its whole budget without ever reaching the service\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this equivalently; 'burns' and 'spends' are synonymous.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-044\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"the log afterwards shows nothing at all except a long run of refusals\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"This necessarily means no successes appear in the log, only refusals.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-045\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not state whose budget is wasted in this scenario.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-046\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text states this equivalently; not needing a larger cap means the same as getting what is needed without cap change.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-047\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not state that moving work to quieter hours is available to almost everybody.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-048\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"A cap can be raised\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-049\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text does not explicitly state the team looks at load smoothness before looking at the cap number.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-050\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this equivalently.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-051\",\n      \"verdict\": \"SUPPORTED\",\n      \"evidence\": \"There is no expedited path\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states this claim exactly.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-052\",\n      \"verdict\": \"PARTIAL\",\n      \"evidence\": \"they are answered within two working days\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The text says 'within' two days, not that answers necessarily take two days; some may take fewer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-053\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text does not address whether chasing a request affects how long it takes to get an answer.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":105139,"type":"result","duration_ms":170420,"uuid":"412a73f6-393d-460a-a1a4-02e7e7a324ad","ttft_stream_ms":1217,"time_to_request_ms":107,"first_content_frame_ms":1218,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
